{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は風が秋のにおいになって良いですね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い寒い大好き♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NARUTOあと5週で終わるってジャンプの表紙にあったよ思わず本屋さんで発狂する所でした笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あふふあふふ。。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は最後まできちんと見届ける！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はアンダーLIVE見てきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなさんと一緒に見ました〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆の一生懸命が伝わってきて、二期生が成長してる所が沢山観れたのが良かったな〜！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が言うのもあれだけど、皆ひとりひとりのカラーが強くなっていて私も頑張らなきゃってパワーが漲ったよ〜！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいたら泣いてるし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆っっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感動をありがとうっ！！☆彡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうライブのチケット売り切れてるよね〜。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの皆さん全員に見て欲しいなって思ったよ〜！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵なステージでしたっ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/10/11/3570774/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"千秋楽のステージは見に行けないけど、きっと今日よりもっとみんなのパワーが上がってすごいLIVEになるんだろうな〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もそう思ってもらえるステージをつくらないとねっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなファイトでっせ〜！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/10/11/3570774/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あいにくあたくし今日すっぴんでみんなと写真撮ってないので、代わりにこの子をのせよう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/10/11/3570774/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だーれだっ⁈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/10/11/3570774/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみちゃんでーす！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}